### ===========================================================================
### 06 — Spring Security & Better-Auth HTTP Client Requests
### Run the server first: ./gradlew :06-spring-security-auth:bootRun
### ===========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Public catalog: browse books without authentication (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books

### 2. Attempt protected action without authentication (401 Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unauthorized Book",
  "authorId": 1,
  "isbn": "9781234567890",
  "priceCents": 999,
  "stock": 5
}

### 3. Sign in as Alice Customer (saves token and sets cookie)
# @name aliceLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@bookstore.test",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("alice_token", response.body.token);
%}

### 4. Inspect current session as Alice using Bearer token (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}

### 5. Inspect current session using cookie (if client supports automatic cookie jar)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### 6. Place an order as authenticated Alice (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "bookId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 7. View Alice's personal orders (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}

### 8. Alice attempts to perform Admin action (403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hacker Book",
  "authorId": 1,
  "isbn": "9780000000001",
  "priceCents": 100,
  "stock": 1
}

### 9. Sign in as Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@bookstore.test",
  "password": "admin123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.token);
%}

### 10. Admin adds a new book to catalog (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hyperion",
  "authorId": 1,
  "isbn": "9780553283686",
  "priceCents": 1599,
  "stock": 8
}

### 11. Admin views all bookstore orders (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 12. View Alice's active sessions / devices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}

### 13. Alice signs out (invalidates database session token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-out
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}

### 14. Subsequent request with Alice's revoked token fails (401 Problem Details)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session
Authorization: Bearer {{alice_token}}
